<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#35604C">
<title>Term Race - Chen Laoshi's Teaching Toolkit</title>
<%- include('../partials/seo', { pageDescription: 'Arrange subject terms in a sunflower wheel and grid for a fast partner clue-and-find game.' }) %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/site-theme.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/shared/library-picker.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/low-prep/character-race/character-race.css">
</head>
<body class="cr-page">
<div class="cr-wrap">
  <header class="cr-header">
    <a href="/teaching-tools#low-prep-activities" class="back-btn">← Back to Teaching Tools</a>
    <div class="fl"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><g fill="#F6C43C" stroke="#1B2A47" stroke-width="3"><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(0 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(30 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(60 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(90 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(120 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(150 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(180 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(210 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(240 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(270 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(300 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(330 50 50)"/></g><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="15" fill="#4A3520" stroke="#1B2A47" stroke-width="3"/></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><g fill="#F6C43C" stroke="#1B2A47" stroke-width="3"><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(0 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(30 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(60 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(90 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(120 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(150 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(180 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(210 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(240 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(270 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(300 50 50)"/><ellipse cx="50" cy="20" rx="9" ry="17" transform="rotate(330 50 50)"/></g><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="15" fill="#4A3520" stroke="#1B2A47" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div>
    <h1>Term Race</h1>
    <p>Arrange terms in a wheel—one partner gives a clue, the other finds the answer, and then they switch roles.</p>
  </header>

  <div id="coreWarn" class="warn" style="display:none">
    The optional vocabulary module is unavailable. Saved language lists and automatic pinyin will not work, but manual entry still does.
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">1</span>Add your terms <span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#5A6B57">Total <b id="count">0</b></span></h2>
    <p class="hint">Enter one short term per line. You can also separate single-word items with spaces. Duplicates are removed automatically.</p>
    <textarea id="src" placeholder="hypothesis&#10;evidence&#10;variable&#10;observe&#10;measure"></textarea>
    <p class="hint">Language teachers can add optional pronunciation and meaning with <code>term | pronunciation | definition</code>.</p>
    <div id="raceLibraryPicker"></div>
    <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
      <button id="btnMake" class="primary">Build the wheel</button>
      <button id="btnFromList">Use a saved word list</button>
      <button id="btnDemo" class="ghost">Load a sample</button>
      <button id="btnShuffle">Shuffle positions</button>
      <button id="btnClear" class="mini">Clear</button>
    </div>
    <div class="row" style="margin-top:12px">
      <input type="text" id="title" placeholder="Title, e.g. Lesson 3 · New Words" style="flex:1 1 240px">
    </div>
    <div id="chips" class="chips" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
    <p class="hint" id="empty" style="margin:8px 0 0">No terms yet—enter your own list above, or choose “Load a sample.”</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">2</span>Layout</h2>
    <p class="hint">A single ring is easiest to read; 12–20 short terms work best. Over 30 terms automatically split into three rings, but text gets smaller—for younger grades, print two sheets instead.</p>
    <div class="row">
      <span class="field">Support line
        <select id="optTargetLanguage" aria-label="Support line">
          <option value="english" selected>Definition</option>
          <option value="pinyin">Pinyin</option>
        </select>
      </span>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="optFlower" checked> Sunflower style</label>
      <span class="field">Rings
        <select id="optRings"><option value="auto">Auto</option><option value="1">One</option><option value="2">Two</option><option value="3">Three</option></select>
      </span>
      <span class="field">Text size
        <select id="optSize"><option value="auto">Auto</option><option value="34">Small</option><option value="46">Medium</option><option value="60">Large</option></select>
      </span>
      <span class="field">Grid squares
        <select id="optGrid"><option value="16">16</option><option value="20" selected>20</option><option value="25">25</option></select>
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="hint" id="targetLanguageHint" aria-live="polite" style="margin:8px 0 0">Each tile shows the term with its optional definition underneath.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">3</span>Preview</h2>
    <div id="preview"></div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><span class="num">4</span>Play &amp; export</h2>
    <div class="row">
      <button id="btnGame" class="dark">▶ Big-screen finding game</button>
      <button id="btnPrint1" class="primary">Print one (wheel + grid)</button>
      <button id="btnPrint4">Print four</button>
      <button id="btnPPTX">Export PPTX</button>
      <button id="btnPDF">PDF</button>
      <button id="btnPNG">Image</button>
    </div>
    <p class="hint" style="margin-top:10px">
      Each printed A4 sheet has the wheel on top and a grid sheet below — one sheet per pair. The big-screen mode works well for a whole-class warm-up or game.
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer>Chen Laoshi's Teaching Toolkit · Term Race v1.0</footer>
  <div id="printArea"></div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/tool-guide', { toolGuide: toolGuide }) %>

<div id="game">
  <div id="gstage"></div>
  <div id="gbar">
    <button id="gNext" class="primary">Draw a term (Space)</button>
    <button id="gSay" class="mini">Say it again</button>
    <label class="check" style="color:#F2F6EF"><input type="checkbox" id="optSpeak" checked> Read aloud</label>
    <span style="width:16px"></span>
    <span class="big">Correct <span id="gscore">0</span></span>
    <span class="big">Missed <span id="gmiss">0</span></span>
    <span class="big">Time left <span id="gleft">60</span>s</span>
    <span class="field" style="color:#F2F6EF">Duration
      <select id="gtime"><option value="30">30</option><option value="60" selected>60</option><option value="120">120</option></select>
    </span>
    <button id="gStart">Start timer</button>
    <button id="gStop" class="mini">Pause</button>
    <button id="gAgain" class="mini">Reset</button>
    <button id="gExit">Exit</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="toast" class="toast"></div>

<script src="/shared/wordlist-core.js"></script>
<script src="/shared/deck-export.js"></script>
<script src="/shared/library-picker.js"></script>
<script src="/low-prep/character-race/character-race.js"></script>
<script src="/javascripts/account-coming-soon.js"></script>
<script src="/javascripts/milk-tea-footer.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
